      | Eco |
    # Post-test reset
    When the staff user deselects the following schemes
      | Eco |
    And the staff user submits the amendment and confirms
    And the staff user amends the application for herd "J1400098" for scheme year "2024"
    Then the following schemes should have their noted selection
